  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Monster Bait\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" title=\"Image:Monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Summons a BBQ Turkey Leg that can lure monsters away from you.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Monster Bait</b> is a skill that when used spawns a BBQ Turkey Leg.  Nearby mobs will be lured away from you. While the Turkey Leg is being attacked, use the few seconds it provides to target the lower level fodder around whatever you're fighting against, or even to cast a portal to escape. It is especially useful in most boss fights to distract the boss or its minions. Monster bait can also be used when, for example, you accidentally agro 2 groups. You can split the mobs between the Turkey Leg and yourself to take less damage. There is also a Passive called <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Crispy_Monster_Bait\" title=\"Extra Crispy Monster Bait\">Extra Crispy Monster Bait</a> that will boost your Monster Bait's health by 100%. The monster bait's level is mostly equal to the level you need to buy the rank of Monster Bait itself.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 45 seconds.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Summons a level X monstrous BBQ Turkey Leg that may lure monsters away from you for a short period of time.</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 19\n</td><td> 24\n</td><td> 29\n</td><td> 34\n</td><td> 39\n</td><td> 44\n</td><td> 49\n</td><td> 54\n</td><td> 59\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X\n</td><td> 19\n</td><td> 24\n</td><td> 29\n</td><td> 34\n</td><td> 39\n</td><td> 44\n</td><td> 49\n</td><td> 54\n</td><td> 59\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 198.5\n</td><td> 234.9\n</td><td> 271.4\n</td><td> 307.8\n</td><td> 344.3\n</td><td> 380.7\n</td><td> 417.2\n</td><td> 453.6\n</td><td> 490.1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 26448\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">17\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 64\n</td><td> 69\n</td><td> 74\n</td><td> 79\n</td><td> 84\n</td><td> 89\n</td><td> 94\n</td><td> 99\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X\n</td><td> 64\n</td><td> 69\n</td><td> 74\n</td><td> 79\n</td><td> 84\n</td><td> 89\n</td><td> 94\n</td><td> 99\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 526.5\n</td><td> 562.9\n</td><td> 599.4\n</td><td> 635.8\n</td><td> 672.3\n</td><td> 708.7\n</td><td> 745.2\n</td><td> 781.6\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> \n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
